5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to check the morning routine upstairs and the unplanned shuffles. I hate losing my little gaps between meetings!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to understand the financial reality before we move anything. I will look into the floor billing basis and the facilities quote.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I will look into the drawn plan against the staff survey and what this year's two joiners reported.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I’ll check the sound meter readings and the physio’s note. Comfort is the only thing that actually matters after eight hours.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m picking the arrival times and the two project strands. I want to see how our days actually flow before we lock anything in!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if the quote is huge, maybe we just keep the desks? I don't want to lose my gaps to moving boxes!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the quote is per desk, not a lump sum. We pay only if we move. I am checking the billing basis to see if we can afford the change at all.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, the gaps are real, but so is the noise. I’m checking the survey to see if daylight is worth the disruption.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, daylight is a luxury. I care about the decibels and the chair. If the sound is bad, no amount of sun fixes my back.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, comfort matters, but so does connection! I’m checking how we actually talk to each other. If we sit apart, we stop sharing ideas.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Yumi, connection is great, but I need my coffee break! If moving desks eats my gaps, I’m stuck in meetings all day.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the billing basis shows we pay for empty space. Moving desks might actually save money if we consolidate.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, saving money is good, but fairness is better. I want to know who gets the window and who gets the wall.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, fairness is just a word for who gets the quiet. I’m checking the sound levels. If the wall is loud, I’m not sitting there, no matter who else is.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, I hear you, but silence doesn’t build trust! I’m checking how we actually talk. If we sit apart, we stop sharing ideas.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, fairness means I don’t lose my gaps! If the layout steals my coffee break, I’m not happy. Let’s see what the data says!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the data will show if consolidation saves the budget. I am waiting for the billing figures to confirm the monthly cost.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
