36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the billing is by area, not heads. We pay 41,000 yen monthly for empty desks. Moving costs 6,200 yen per desk.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, the survey confirms daylight is the top complaint. Four windows, three walls. I need to know who takes the worse end.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, nine decibels is a wall of noise. Plus, my chair takes days to settle. I refuse to sit by the printer.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, that empty space cost is huge! But here’s the thing: we arrive at totally different times. If seats are first-come, half of us are locked out before we even get here!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, four to nine minutes every morning? That’s my coffee gap gone! And two weeks of chaos last year? I’m terrified of moving boxes!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the morning delay is real, but the 41,000 yen monthly loss is worse. We are paying for empty space. Consolidating saves that.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, the joiners learned the unwritten work by overhearing. If we isolate people, we lose that. I need to know who sits where.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, overhearing is luck, not strategy. My chair takes days to settle. I won’t trade that for accidental gossip.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, exactly! When we sat close last spring, we stopped writing notes because we just talked. If we scatter, we lose that instant connection.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
